   = note: root cause: the provider trait implementation is forwarded to `Path!(@app.GreeterComponent)` in `App`, but `App` contains no delegate entry for `Path!(@app.GreeterComponent)`
           this is required through the dependency chain:
               consumer trait impl `CanGreet` for context `App`
               └── provider trait impl `Greeter` with context `App` for provider `RedirectLookup<App, Path!(@app.GreeterComponent)>`

